#: includes/Analyze/Knowledge_Base.php:70
msgid "WordPress runs scheduled tasks (publishing scheduled posts, sending emails, backups, update checks) with WP-Cron. Some of these tasks are late or will never run."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Analyze/Knowledge_Base.php:71
msgid "WP-Cron only runs when someone visits the site, or it is disabled with DISABLE_WP_CRON and no server cron job replaces it. A blocked loopback request can also stop it."
msgstr ""

