msgid "Check Tools → Site Health for \"loopback request\" or \"scheduled event\" problems."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Analyze/Knowledge_Base.php:74
msgid "If DISABLE_WP_CRON is set, ask your host to add a server cron job that calls wp-cron.php every 5 minutes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Analyze/Knowledge_Base.php:75
msgid "Look at the System screen of this plugin to see which tasks are late and which plugin owns them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Analyze/Knowledge_Base.php:81
msgid "A scheduled task is still registered, but no plugin handles it any more. It does nothing but keeps being rescheduled."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Analyze/Knowledge_Base.php:82
msgid "The plugin that created it was removed without cleaning up."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Analyze/Knowledge_Base.php:84
msgid "Check that you really removed the plugin that owned this task (the hook name usually starts with its name)."
