msgstr ""

#: includes/Analyze/Knowledge_Base.php:94
msgid "A database query takes long enough to slow page loads. Repeated slow queries make the whole site feel sluggish and can overload the database server."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Analyze/Knowledge_Base.php:95
msgid "Usually a missing index, a query over a large table (for example postmeta or options with many autoloaded rows), or a plugin running a heavy report on every page."
msgstr ""

